The tag predates the PR base, so these files were adapted:
- automake 1.18 -> 1.20 (PR: 1.19 -> 1.20), incl. CONFIG_SUB/CONFIG_GUESS
- cargo-c 0.10.13 -> 0.10.26 (PR: 0.10.15 -> 0.10.26), Cargo.lock from the PR
- fribidi 1.0.16 -> 1.0.18 (PR: 1.0.17 -> 1.0.18), only VERSION/SHA512
